      "writtenOn": "2015-08-19T21:04:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looking closer, I don\u0027t think this \u0027-1 \u003d\u003d max\u0027 feature is helpful at all. I changed the only call that passed -1 to instead pass PD_MAX_VOLTAGE_MV. Furthermore, I don\u0027t think the \u0027dev\u0027 console command ever worked with parameter -1, due to the multiplication we do (* 1000). If we parse -1 from the console, we\u0027ll end up passing -1000 to the function, not -1.",
