      "writtenOn": "2015-08-18T18:25:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My idea was to make the \"pd dev \u003ccurrent\u003e \u003cvoltage\u003e\" command behave in exactly the same way as the host command with those parameters. I\u0027ll leave \"pd dev\" alone and add a new sub-command here instead, since we don\u0027t want \"pd dev\" to be changed.",
      "parentUuid": "c4a9e95f_b88158a0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2891,
        "startChar": 2,
